.el .ds Aq '
.TH scrollreversed 5 2026-11-03 "scrollreversed 0.1.0" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
scrollreversed \- configuration file for scrollreversed
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fI~/Library/Application Support/scrollreversed/config.toml\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBscrollreversed\fR(1) reads its settings at startup from a TOML file in the user\*(Aqs Application Support directory.  The \fB\-\-config\fR option names a different file.
.PP
Every key is optional, and a missing file leaves every setting at its default.  Unknown keys and values are errors.  Options given on the command line override the file.  Changes take effect when scrollreversed restarts.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\fBdevice\fR = \fIstring\fR
Device whose scrolling is reversed.  Defaults to "mouse".
.RS
.TP
\fB"mouse"\fR
Mice, including the Magic Mouse
.RE
.RS
.TP
\fB"trackpad"\fR
Built\-in and external trackpads
.RE
.RS
.TP
\fB"all"\fR
Every device
.RE
.TP
\fBaxis\fR = \fIstring\fR
Axis along which scrolling is reversed.  Defaults to "both".
.RS
.TP
\fB"vertical"\fR
Vertical scrolling only
.RE
.RS
.TP
\fB"horizontal"\fR
Horizontal scrolling only
.RE
.RS
.TP
\fB"both"\fR
Both directions
.RE
.TP
\fBverbose\fR = \fIboolean\fR
Log every scroll event and how it was classified to standard error.  Defaults to false.
.SH EXAMPLES
Reverse only vertical trackpad scrolling, for natural scrolling turned off in System Settings:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
device = "trackpad"
axis = "vertical"
.RE
.fi
.PP
Restart the launchd agent to apply the change:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
launchctl kickstart \-k gui/$(id \-u)/io.yiyuzhou.scrollreversed
.RE
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBscrollreversed\fR(1), \fBlaunchctl\fR(1)
